This product includes software developed by Daniel Sandner
(https://github.com/eigensoundlab/playhead).

No third-party code is bundled. The analysis implements published
standards and methods from their descriptions; with thanks to:

- ITU-R BS.1770 K-weighting filter coefficients, as given in the
  libebur128 reference implementation (MIT licence).
- ISO 532-1 loudness, DIN 45692 sharpness, and Aures / Daniel & Weber
  roughness weightings, cross-checked against MoSQITo (Apache-2.0).

The IBM Plex fonts are loaded from Google Fonts at runtime and are
